{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p129a","title":"议定立秋治兵之礼","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p129a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"有司奏请不再四时讲武，改为立秋择吉日大朝车骑，号治兵，奏议获准。","evidence":["wudi-e-p129a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二十一年","year":216,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p129a-q","wudi-q-o181","wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681"],"chronology":"wudi-y216","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o181","basis":"建安二十一年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1047,"P129a"],"order":395}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p129a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fd8400a55c498cd26ddd","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“有司奏：‘四时讲武于农隙。汉承秦制，三时不讲；唯十月都试，车（马）〔驾〕幸长水南门，会五营士，为八阵进退，名曰“乘之”。今金革未偃，士民素习。自今以后，可无四时讲武；但以立秋择吉日大朝车骑，号曰“治兵”：上合礼名，下承汉制。’奏，可。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":371,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6bdc3d244899f8c0a09c","start":0,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十一年：建安二十一年（公元 216）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fbf1801762e86de3cad","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o181","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-13ff126a9ae1c811de3d","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年春二月〖1〗，公还邺。﹝一﹞三月壬寅〖2〗，公亲耕籍田。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"off